<title>THAILAND: Thailand approves Don Muang Tollway extension.</title>
<headline>Thailand approves Don Muang Tollway extension.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai cabinet has approved plans for a 7.8 kilometre (five mile) northern extension of the Don Muang Tollway, Transport and Communications Minister Suwat Liptapallop said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Suwat said bidding on the project, worth 4 billion baht, would open as soon as possible.</p>
<p>The project is designed to ease access from Bangkok to the 1998 Asian Games venue in Rangsit, in the northern outskirts of the Thai capital. ($1 = 26 baht)</p>
